title: Linux Host Connecting to Rank Math Backdoor C2 Domain (rank1cdn.com)
id: 8da49770-9a72-4b57-b536-9eae7424ec15
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects a Linux web server or WordPress host resolving or connecting to
    rank1cdn.com, the command-and-control domain used by the trojanized
    Rank Math PRO 3.0.123 plugin. The malicious plugin build communicates
    with this domain and recreates hidden backdoors whenever an infected
    site is visited.
references:
    - https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/wordpress-seo-plugin-rank-math-compromised-to-backdoor-websites/
    - https://www.securityweek.com/rank-math-pro-wordpress-plugin-compromised-in-supply-chain-attack/
    - https://thehackernews.com/2026/10/popular-wordpress-seo-plugin-rank-math.html
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/10/20
tags:
    - attack.t1195
    - attack.t1071
    - attack.t1505
logsource:
    category: network_connection
    product: linux
detection:
    selection:
        DestinationHostname|endswith: 'rank1cdn.com'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - None expected - rank1cdn.com is attacker-controlled infrastructure with no legitimate use
level: high
